<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Recollect"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="TV动画《Re：从零开始的异世界生活 第四季》片头曲"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Ashnikko"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Konomi Suzuki"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Re:ZERO Music"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="鈴木このみ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="铃木木乃美"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Recollect"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Recollect - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPR502602113"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3369728529"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001OuyqF2oCACC"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="656435256"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="3Ltu1EsS0IiHNJcJYwfTkL"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1891689523"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:07.570"><div begin="3.930" end="3:07.570"><p begin="3.930" end="9.730" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="6.720" end="6.900">Tran</span><span begin="6.900" end="7.040">s</span><span begin="7.040" end="7.370">for</span><span begin="7.370" end="7.660">ming</span> <span begin="7.660" end="7.710">the</span> <span begin="7.850" end="8.210">pain</span> <span begin="8.210" end="8.480">and</span> <span begin="8.480" end="8.670">re</span><span begin="8.670" end="8.920">wri</span><span begin="8.920" end="9.130">ting</span> <span begin="9.130" end="9.330">your</span> <span begin="9.330" end="9.730">name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转化这痛楚 重写你的名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">轉化這痛楚 重寫你的名字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">痛みを変換し君の名前を書き換える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고통을 변화시키고 너의 이름을 다시 써 내려가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Transformant la douleur et réécrivant ton nom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Transformando el dolor y reescribiendo tu nombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Schmerz verwandelnd und deinen Namen neu schreibend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Transformando a dor e reescrevendo o seu nome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Преобразуя боль и переписывая твое имя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Trasformando il dolore e riscrivendo il tuo nome</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3.930" end="5.180"><span begin="3.930" end="4.030">(Gi</span><span begin="4.140" end="4.350">ga,</span> <span begin="4.550" end="4.650">Ted</span><span begin="4.650" end="4.770">dy</span><span begin="4.970" end="5.180">Loid)</span></span></p><p begin="10.260" end="13.260" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.260" end="10.290">「</span><span begin="10.290" end="10.840">零</span><span begin="10.840" end="10.870">」</span><span begin="10.930" end="11.490">戻</span><span begin="11.490" end="11.680">り</span><span begin="11.800" end="12.000">ま</span><span begin="12.000" end="12.070">た</span><span begin="12.210" end="12.500">再</span><span begin="12.600" end="13.260">生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">归于零 再次重生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">歸於零 再次重生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Returning to &quot;zero&quot; and regenerating again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">「영」으로 돌아가 다시 재생해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Retournant à « Zéro » et renaissant à nouveau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Regresando a «cero» y reproduciéndome de nuevo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zurück auf &quot;Null&quot; und wiedergeboren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Retornando a «Zero» e regenerando novamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Возвращаюсь к «нулю» и снова перерождаюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ritorno allo «zero» e rinasco di nuovo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">&quot;Zero&quot; modori mata saisei</span></p><p begin="13.440" end="15.290" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="13.440" end="13.630">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="13.630" end="13.860">lo</span><span begin="13.860" end="14.020">st</span> <span begin="14.020" end="14.280">in</span> <span begin="14.280" end="14.490">the</span> <span begin="14.490" end="14.750">hol</span><span begin="14.750" end="15.170">low</span><span begin="15.170" end="15.290">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我迷失在无尽的空洞之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我迷失在無盡的空洞之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">虚無の中に迷い込む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 공허함 속에서 길을 잃었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis perdue dans les abysses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy perdida en los vacíos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich bin verloren in der Leere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Estou perdida nos vazios</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я потеряна в пустотах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sono persa nei vuoti</span></p><p begin="15.240" end="18.650" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.240" end="15.580">運</span><span begin="15.580" end="15.890">命</span><span begin="15.890" end="16.400">廻</span><span begin="16.400" end="16.590">れ</span><span begin="16.590" end="16.620">、</span><span begin="16.920" end="17.260">悠</span><span begin="17.260" end="17.560">久</span><span begin="17.560" end="17.790">の</span><span begin="17.790" end="18.030">パ</span><span begin="18.030" end="18.650">レード</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命运轮回 悠久的巡游</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">命運輪迴 悠久的巡遊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Fate revolves, an eternal parade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">운명이여 돌아라, 끝없는 행렬이여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que le destin tourne, une parade éternelle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Gira el destino, un desfile eterno</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dreh dich Schicksal eine ewige Parade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Gire o destino, um desfile eterno</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вращайся судьба вечный парад</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Gira destino in un&apos;eterna parata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Unmei maware, yuukyuu no pareedo</span></p><p begin="18.810" end="20.510" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="18.810" end="19.030">I</span> <span begin="19.030" end="19.200">know</span> <span begin="19.200" end="19.410">the</span> <span begin="19.410" end="19.560">fate</span> <span begin="19.670" end="19.890">that</span> <span begin="19.890" end="20.030">a</span><span begin="20.030" end="20.330">wai</span><span begin="20.330" end="20.510">ts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深知那等待着的宿命</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我深知那等待著的宿命</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">待ち受ける運命は分かっている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 기다리는 운명을 알고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je connais le destin qui m&apos;attend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Conozco el destino que me espera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich kenne das Schicksal das mich erwartet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu conheço o destino que aguarda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я знаю судьбу что ждет впереди</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Conosco il destino che mi attende</span></p><p begin="20.260" end="23.160" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="20.260" end="20.620">Chan</span><span begin="20.620" end="20.710">ge</span> <span begin="20.910" end="20.990">me,</span> <span begin="21.100" end="21.440">for</span><span begin="21.440" end="21.530">ge</span> <span begin="21.730" end="21.950">me,</span> <span begin="21.950" end="22.270">ma</span><span begin="22.270" end="22.330">ke</span> <span begin="22.550" end="22.770">me</span> <span begin="22.770" end="23.160">new</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">改变我 锤炼我 让我焕然一新</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">改變我 錘鍊我 讓我煥然一新</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を変えて 鍛え上げて 新しくして</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 변화시키고, 단련하여, 새롭게 만들어 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Change-moi, forge-moi, fais-moi renaître</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cámbiame, fórjame, hazme nueva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verändere mich schmiede mich mach mich neu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mude-me, forje-me, faça-me nova</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Измени меня перекуй меня сделай меня новой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Cambiami forgiami rendimi nuova</span></p><p begin="23.590" end="25.190" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="23.590" end="23.800">Make</span> <span begin="23.800" end="24.000">me</span> <span begin="24.000" end="24.110">my</span><span begin="24.110" end="24.230">th,</span> <span begin="24.230" end="24.370">ma</span><span begin="24.370" end="24.420">ke</span> <span begin="24.420" end="24.600">me</span> <span begin="24.600" end="24.830">le</span><span begin="24.830" end="25.190">gend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我化作神话 让我成为传奇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我化作神話 讓我成為傳奇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を神話にして 伝説にして</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 신화로, 전설로 만들어 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fais de moi un mythe, fais de moi une légende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hazme un mito, hazme una leyenda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mach mich zum Mythos mach mich zur Legende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Faça de mim um mito, faça de mim uma lenda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сделай меня мифом сделай меня легендой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Rendimi un mito rendimi una leggenda</span></p><p begin="25.230" end="26.380" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="25.230" end="25.470">Die</span> <span begin="25.470" end="25.670">and</span> <span begin="25.670" end="25.890">I</span> <span begin="25.890" end="25.970">re</span><span begin="26.070" end="26.380">boot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">死去 然后重启</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">死去 然後重啟</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">死して私は再起動する</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">죽고 나서 다시 시작해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je meurs et je redémarre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Muero y me reinicio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sterbe und boote neu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Morro e reinicio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Умираю и перезагружаюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Muoio e mi riavvio</span></p><p begin="26.880" end="29.700" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="26.880" end="27.220">E</span><span begin="27.220" end="27.300">ve</span><span begin="27.520" end="27.720">ry</span><span begin="27.720" end="28.040">thing</span> <span begin="28.310" end="28.540">I</span> <span begin="28.540" end="28.880">do</span> <span begin="29.140" end="29.410">for</span> <span begin="29.410" end="29.700">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所做的一切皆是为了你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我所做的一切皆是為了你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私の全ては君のために</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 하는 모든 것은 널 위한 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout ce que je fais est pour toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo lo que hago por ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles was ich tue tue ich für dich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo o que eu faço é por você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё что я делаю всё ради тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto ciò che faccio è per te</span></p><p begin="29.770" end="31.810" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="29.770" end="30.000">Go</span> <span begin="30.000" end="30.220">on</span> <span begin="30.220" end="30.620">wield</span> <span begin="30.620" end="30.840">me</span> <span begin="30.840" end="31.000">li</span><span begin="31.000" end="31.050">ke</span> <span begin="31.050" end="31.210">a</span> <span begin="31.210" end="31.330">wea</span><span begin="31.430" end="31.810">pon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 将我如武器般挥舞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">來吧 將我如武器般揮舞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">さあ私を武器のように振るって</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어서 나를 무기처럼 휘둘러 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Vas-y manie-moi comme une arme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Adelante empúñame como un arma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Los führe mich wie eine Waffe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vá em frente me empunhe como uma arma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай же орудуй мной как оружием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dai impugnami come un&apos;arma</span></p><p begin="31.860" end="33.040" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="31.860" end="32.040">Let</span> <span begin="32.040" end="32.280">me</span> <span begin="32.280" end="32.440">meet</span> <span begin="32.440" end="32.590">my</span> <span begin="32.690" end="33.040">doom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我迎接我的末日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我迎接我的末日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">破滅を迎えさせて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 파멸을 맞이하게 해 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Laisse-moi rencontrer ma perte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Déjame encontrar mi perdición</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass mich meinem Untergang begegnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixe-me encontrar a minha perdição</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Позволь мне встретить свою погибель</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasciami incontrare la mia rovina</span></p><p begin="33.520" end="36.690" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.520" end="34.370">嗚呼</span><span begin="34.370" end="34.400">、</span><span begin="34.740" end="34.950">焦</span><span begin="34.950" end="35.780">が</span><span begin="35.780" end="35.880">す</span><span begin="36.190" end="36.270">鼓</span><span begin="36.390" end="36.690">動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 焦灼的悸动</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 焦灼的悸動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah, the scorching heartbeat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아, 애태우는 고동</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah ces battements de cœur qui me consument</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah, un latido que arde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah der brennende Herzschlag</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah, batida do coração que queima</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах это обжигающее биение сердца</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah un battito che brucia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, kogasu kodou</span></p><p begin="36.800" end="40.010" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.800" end="36.990">繰</span><span begin="36.990" end="37.130">り</span><span begin="37.130" end="37.330">返</span><span begin="37.330" end="37.430">し</span><span begin="37.430" end="37.530">て</span><span begin="37.650" end="38.290">も</span><span begin="38.290" end="38.320">、</span><span begin="38.470" end="38.780">絶</span><span begin="38.780" end="39.110">望</span><span begin="39.110" end="39.300">に</span><span begin="39.300" end="39.880">抗</span><span begin="39.880" end="40.010">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕无限循环 也要反抗绝望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕無限循環 也要反抗絕望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if it repeats, defy despair</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">반복된다 해도, 절망에 맞서라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je dois répéter, je résisterai au désespoir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque se repita, resiste a la desesperación</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn es sich wiederholt leiste der Verzweiflung Widerstand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que se repita, resista ao desespero</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже повторяя это вновь и вновь сопротивляйся отчаянию</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se si ripete resisti alla disperazione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kurikaeshite mo, zetsubou ni aragae</span></p><p begin="40.110" end="42.810" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.110" end="40.600">Ah,</span> <span begin="41.190" end="42.230">oh-</span><span begin="42.230" end="42.810">whoa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 喔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 喔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ オオ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아, 오-워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah, oh-whoa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah, oh-whoa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah oh-whoa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah, oh-whoa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах о-уоу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah oh-whoa</span></p><p begin="43.200" end="45.310" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.200" end="43.830">命</span><span begin="43.830" end="44.050">か</span><span begin="44.050" end="44.260">き</span><span begin="44.260" end="44.460">鳴</span><span begin="44.460" end="44.650">ら</span><span begin="44.650" end="44.770">し</span><span begin="44.870" end="45.310">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奏响生命的强音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">奏響生命的強音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Strumming my life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">목숨을 튕겨 울리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Faisant résonner ma vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Haciendo resonar la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Leben laut aufspielend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Fazendo a vida ressoar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Заставляя жизнь звучать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Suonando la mia vita a squarciagola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Inochi kakinarashite</span></p><p begin="45.700" end="49.150" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.700" end="45.790">名</span><span begin="45.900" end="46.100">を</span><span begin="46.100" end="46.190">失</span><span begin="46.280" end="46.430">く</span><span begin="46.520" end="46.640">し</span><span begin="46.750" end="47.030">て</span><span begin="47.170" end="47.490">も</span><span begin="47.490" end="47.520">、</span><span begin="47.580" end="47.860">僕</span><span begin="47.860" end="48.010">は</span><span begin="48.180" end="48.410">在</span><span begin="48.410" end="48.690">る</span><span begin="48.790" end="49.150">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕失去名字 我也依然存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕失去名字 我也依然存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I lose my name, saying that I exist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이름을 잃는다 해도, 나는 존재한다고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je perds mon nom, j&apos;existe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso si pierdo mi nombre, yo existo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn ich meinen Namen verliere existiere ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que eu perca meu nome, eu existo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если я потеряю имя я всё равно существую</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se perdo il mio nome io esisto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Na o nakushite mo, boku wa aru to</span></p><p begin="49.210" end="52.120" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.210" end="49.520">滅</span><span begin="49.520" end="49.630">び</span><span begin="49.850" end="50.050">の</span><span begin="50.050" end="50.730">中</span><span begin="50.730" end="50.760">、</span><span begin="50.860" end="51.200">響</span><span begin="51.200" end="51.510">く</span><span begin="51.510" end="51.720">ア</span><span begin="51.720" end="51.940">リ</span><span begin="51.940" end="52.120">ア</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毁灭之中 回荡的咏叹调</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">毀滅之中 回盪的詠嘆調</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Amidst ruin, an echoing aria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멸망 속에서, 울려 퍼지는 아리아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une aria résonnant dans la ruine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En medio de la ruina, resuena un aria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Arie die im Untergang widerhallt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A ária que ressoa em meio à ruína</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Среди разрушения звучит ария</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In mezzo alla distruzione un&apos;aria risuona</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Horobi no naka, hibiku aria</span></p><p begin="52.730" end="57.430" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.730" end="53.180">愛</span><span begin="53.180" end="53.360">の</span><span begin="53.360" end="53.770">答</span><span begin="53.770" end="54.160">え</span> <span begin="54.570" end="54.790">裂</span><span begin="54.790" end="56.060">き</span><span begin="56.240" end="56.720">繋</span><span begin="56.720" end="56.880">い</span><span begin="56.880" end="57.430">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱的答案 被撕裂又重新相连</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">愛的答案 被撕裂又重新相連</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The answer of love torn and connected</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑의 대답을 찢어 발기고 이어 붙였어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai déchiré et relié la réponse de l&apos;amour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desgarré y uní la respuesta del amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Antwort der Liebe zerrissen und verbunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A resposta do amor, rasgada e unida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разрывая и связывая ответ любви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho strappato e unito la risposta dell&apos;amore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ai no kotae sakitsunaida</span></p><p begin="57.090" end="58.430" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="57.090" end="57.210">Brea</span><span begin="57.300" end="57.330">k</span> <span begin="57.330" end="57.430">it,</span> <span begin="57.520" end="57.730">burn</span> <span begin="57.730" end="57.810">it,</span> <span begin="57.900" end="58.110">sa</span><span begin="58.110" end="58.160">ve</span> <span begin="58.160" end="58.430">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打破它 烧毁它 拯救它</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">打破它 燒毀它 拯救它</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">壊して 燃やして 救い出して</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부수고, 불태우고, 구해내</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Brise-le, brûle-le, sauve-le</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Rómpelo, quémalo, sálvalo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zerbrich es verbrenn es rette es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quebre, queime, salve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сломай это сожги это спаси это</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Rompilo brucialo salvalo</span></p><p begin="57.880" end="59.530" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.880" end="58.490">囚</span><span begin="58.490" end="58.790">わ</span><span begin="58.930" end="59.530">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被囚禁着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">被囚禁著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Trapped</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">얽매인 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Captive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Atrapada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gefangen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aprisionada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Плененная</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Prigioniera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Toraware</span></p><p begin="59.320" end="59.750" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="59.320" end="59.750">Yeah!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">耶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">イェー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ouais !</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¡Sí!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Yeah!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Yeah!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Да</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Yeah</span></p><p begin="59.750" end="1:00.780" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.750" end="1:00.010">金</span><span begin="1:00.010" end="1:00.380">輪</span><span begin="1:00.380" end="1:00.780">際</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不退缩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">絕不退縮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Never again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">결단코</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À tout jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nunca más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Niemals wieder</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отныне и навсегда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mai più</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konrinzai</span></p><p begin="1:00.780" end="1:02.960" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:00.780" end="1:00.950">Big</span> <span begin="1:01.080" end="1:01.310">jui</span><span begin="1:01.310" end="1:01.620">cer, and I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:01.620" end="1:01.850">rea</span><span begin="1:01.850" end="1:02.020">dy</span> <span begin="1:02.020" end="1:02.150">to</span> <span begin="1:02.250" end="1:02.760">cru</span><span begin="1:02.760" end="1:02.960">sh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能量拉满 我已准备好粉碎一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">能量拉滿 我已準備好粉碎一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">巨大な力 粉砕する準備はできている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거대한 힘, 전부 짓밟을 준비가 됐어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pleine de puissance et je suis prête à écraser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Gran trituradora, y estoy lista para aplastar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Massive Kraft und ich bin bereit zu zermalmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com poder total, e estou pronta para esmagar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Полная энергии и я готова сокрушать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una forza immensa e sono pronta a distruggere</span></p><p begin="1:03.030" end="1:04.200" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.030" end="1:03.290">もう</span><span begin="1:03.290" end="1:03.530">いい</span><span begin="1:03.670" end="1:04.040">か</span><span begin="1:04.040" end="1:04.170">い</span><span begin="1:04.170" end="1:04.200">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">准备好了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">準備好了嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Are you ready?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제 된 걸까?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Es-tu prête ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Ya estás listo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bist du so weit?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já está pronta?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты уже готов</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sei pronto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mou ii kai?</span></p><p begin="1:03.980" end="1:06.170" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:03.980" end="1:04.120">S</span><span begin="